content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Session Management": {
      "objects": [
        "Moderator",
        "Estimation Session",
        "Timer",
        "Round",
        "Estimation Backlog",
        "Item",
        "Task List"
      ]
    },
    "Voting": {
      "objects": [
        "Team",
        "Moderator",
        "Team Member",
        "Item",
        "Estimate Vote",
        "Voting Reveal",
        "Agreed Estimate"
      ]
    },
    "Session Tracking": {
      "objects": [
        "Stakeholder",
        "Estimation History",
        "Session Log Data"
      ]
    },
    "subdomain connections": [
      "Session Management--Voting",
      "Voting--Session Tracking",
      "Session Management--Session Tracking"
    ]
  }
}
```
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Team",
      "desc": "Group of people estimating work together.",
      "attributes": [
        "Moderator",
        "Team Member"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Moderator",
      "desc": "Person who leads estimation sessions and records results."
    },
    {
      "name": "Team Member",
      "desc": "Person who joins estimation sessions and gives estimates."
    },
    {
      "name": "Estimation Session",
      "desc": "Meeting where the team estimates work items.",
      "attributes": [
        "Timer",
        "Round",
        "Estimation Backlog",
        "Session Log Data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Timer",
      "desc": "Tracks time during estimation rounds."
    },
    {
      "name": "Round",
      "desc": "One estimation cycle for an item."
    },
    {
      "name": "Estimation Backlog",
      "desc": "List of items to be estimated."
    },
    {
      "name": "Session Log Data",
      "desc": "Collected data of all votes, estimates, and results."
    },
    {
      "name": "Item",
      "desc": "Work unit selected for estimation.",
      "attributes": [
        "Estimation History"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Estimation History",
      "desc": "Record of past votes and discussions for an item."
    },
    {
      "name": "Estimate Vote",
      "desc": "Individual estimate from a team member.",
      "attributes": [
        "Estimation Scale"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Estimation Scale",
      "desc": "the scale or metric on which the Item will be rated"
    },
    {
      "name": "Task List",
      "desc": "External source of items added to the backlog."
    },
    {
      "name": "Voting Reveal",
      "desc": "Moment when all votes are shown to the team."
    },
    {
      "name": "Agreed Estimate",
      "desc": "Final shared estimate after discussion."
    },
    {
      "name": "Stakeholder",
      "desc": "Person interested in estimation outcomes."
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Session Management": {
      "derived from": "Session Management Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Session Administrator",
        "Estimation Session",
        "Timer",
        "Round",
        "Estimation Backlog",
        "Item",
        "Task List"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Moderator -> Session Administrator",
        "Item -> Open Item"
      ]
    },
    "Voting": {
      "derived from": "Voting Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Team",
        "Moderator",
        "Team Member",
        "Item",
        "Estimate Vote",
        "Voting Reveal",
        "Agreed Estimate"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Moderator -> Session Moderator",
        "Item -> Discussion Item"
      ]
    },
    "Session Tracking": {
      "derived from": "Session Tracking Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Stakeholder",
        "Estimation History",
        "Session Log Data"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
